
The Skupper Controller
=========================================================


Theory of Operation
------------------------------

The Skupper Controller continuously monitors all the Resources 
(Site, Link, Listener, Connector, AccessGrant, etc.) and keep 
them in sync with the desired state expressed in their Specs.

So it watches the resources, detects changes, makes calls to
the K8S API Server if changes are needed, and updates the Status.

If the Skupper Site is on K8S, then the Controller runs as a 
K8S Deployment. If the Site is instead running on something other
than K8S, like Podman or bare Linux (bare metal), then it runs
as a standalone process.

If the Site is non-K8S then the Controller manages local files 
and local containers, but linking between sites still works the
same way.


